OL,5,G2100 The Big Drought of 1975
OL,6,     FIn 1975, Britain battled a
OL,7,     Fhistoric heatwave. This
OL,8,     Fdocumentary shows how the nation
OL,9,     Fpulled together - from standpipes
OL,10,     Fto shared baths - in a drought
OL,11,     Fthat changed life and policy
OL,12,     Fforever.
